    |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: It's declared as `keep(s: String) -> Vec[String]`.
    = note: This is a view: it points into text that something else owns.
    = note: `keep` keeps its `s` after the call returns, so it needs text of its own.
    = note: Nikaia never copies text behind your back: a copy costs as much as the text is long, so it's written where it happens.
    = help: Write `.clone()` to copy it here.
